SY_TALK("peqReLHXtrQ",[[14,["These are the songs sung in Himalayas, and to be sung here"]],[17,["is something really remarkable, isn’t it?"]],[20,["They brought it all the way here to be sung here."]],[23,["Now I think I have already given you a very,"]],[28,["very long lecture and the speech as you call it,"]],[32,["but some reactions were very good and"]],[38,["some could absorb it very well,"]],[42,["but some they said were sleeping."]],[46,["Now these things happen because of negativity."]],[50,["You have to fight your negativity because negativity"]],[52,["is the thing that ask questions,"]],[57,["because when I am talking I am telling the Truth,"]],[59,["absolute Truth, but it asks questions and it reflects."]],[63,["When it starts reflecting, nothing goes in the head because"]],[66,["you are left with the past sentence and"]],[70,["the present you are not with it, so the whole thing"]],[75,["boils down to something like an escape and then"]],[80,["you escape to sleep off."]],[82,["When I tried My level best today to put you on to your"]],[86,["conscious mind."]],[87,["You have to be conscious, you have to be alert,"]],[91,["and that’s the point is: that unless and until you are"]],[94,["conscious, you cannot ascend."]],[96,["Any abnormal person cannot ascend."]],[100,["You have to normalize yourself."]],[104,["So many of you had lots of abnormalities"]],[107,["which were brought out and thrown away,"]],[112,["and many have been cleansed,"]],[113,["but now if there are some still lingering with it,"]],[117,["they must work it out."]],[119,["They cannot just go on justifying it."]],[124,["Normally negative persons attract a negative personality."]],[128,["So if you have such a negativity of any kind within you,"]],[131,["you should never sit next to a negative person,"]],[133,["never go near such a person, keep away but stick on"]],[137,["with the positive person, like I said stick on"]],[139,["and support your leaders without question,"]],[146,["without questioning, but this is the trouble that"]],[149,["you start fighting your own leader."]],[152,["If the leader say something to you,"]],[153,["you quarrel with the leader, and you argue with the leader,"]],[156,["so it’s finished."]],[158,["I speak through the leaders,"]],[160,["so you don’t question it."]],[162,["If you question it, then there will be a problem,"]],[167,["you have to stick on with your leaders"]],[170,["who are positive people."]],[173,["And if you start questioning them,"]],[175,["then you will be nowhere, no link between you and Me."]],[183,["And this is everywhere, I was told in Switzerland"]],[187,["it is like this, in France now it is better,"]],[190,["it’s used to be like that, everywhere, except for Italy,"]],[194,["I think Italy has the best results."]],[197,["Don’t fight with your leaders; don’t argue with them."]],[200,["Do not reflect about Sahaja Yoga, what can you say?"]],[203,["What do you know? How can you reflect?"]],[207,["What is your knowledge?"]],[210,["Do you question your chemistry teacher when he says"]],[212,["hydrogen, has got two atoms or one atom?  Do you?"]],[222,["And when you start doing this with your ego,"]],[224,["you are thrown out of the realm of evolution."]],[232,["So do not reflect, just listen, and try to take it inside."]],[236,["These are all mantras; take them inside."]],[238,["Instead of that you start questioning,"]],[241,["arguing with your leaders, giving them advices,"]],[245,["please don’t do it, stop it now."]],[247,["This is no politics where everybody can advice,"]],[254,["everybody has to say something."]],[256,["Mostly the bhoots are such;"]],[258,["only the bhootish people go on advising,"]],[260,["and having their own say."]],[262,["And they go against the leaders throughout."]],[265,["Now specially for the elderly people,"]],[267,["I would say because you are more grown up sometimes"]],[270,["than the leader are."]],[271,["Then you think you have the right to correct the leaders,"]],[273,["it’s not so."]],[275,["In Sahaja Yoga, it is not how much you are old,"]],[278,["but it is how much you are evolved."]],[283,["So when you start questioning your leaders and"]],[287,["reflecting on their behavior or anything like that,"]],[291,["and answering them back or also giving your ideas,"]],[295,["you are gone."]],[298,["It’s like a link."]],[300,["Say there’s a link"]],[303,["between the chakras and the cells, say it like that."]],[309,["Now if you deny the chakras, how one has to work it out,"]],[317,["because I am connected with them"]],[319,["and through them you are connected."]],[324,["But when you deny them, then you fall out."]],[328,["I know what to do with the leaders, I choose them,"]],[330,["I arrange them, I organize them, I change them;"]],[334,["I know what to do."]],[335,["Now you people do not challenge them,"]],[338,["is nothing but your ego."]],[339,["In India it doesn’t happen at all, doesn’t happen."]],[344,["Once Mother is appointed somebody this is accept,"]],[345,["because for them this is the Truth"]],[348,["that they have been seeking."]],[350,["The all other are nonsenses, it's all complications,"]],[353,["and because you are so complicated"]],[355,["that they have been look nice,"]],[357,["you think you are surrendering your personalities."]],[359,["Not at all. It’s developing, surrendering yourself"]],[364,["to the sap of life, to the vitality,"]],[367,["to the vital force of life, surrender, accept more,"]],[371,["accept more."]],[372,["This ego can never allow your to take inside anything."]],[377,["Be careful on that."]],[381,["This will never allow you to sleep;"]],[383,["this will never give you peace."]],[385,["It will never allow you to grow;"]],[387,["it will never take you to your own goal,"]],[389,["so surrender that your ego of yours."]],[393,["So one thing I have to tell you: don’t fight, don’t quarrel,"]],[397,["don’t question, don’t reflect about your leaders"]],[401,["to begin with,"]],[404,["otherwise you will be cut off."]],[408,["Keep in his good book."]],[410,["Try to support him, ask him what does he want,"]],[413,["what help he needs."]],[414,["The more you get attached to him,"]],[416,["the more you get closer to him, the more you will get."]],[425,["But see people are very wasteful."]],[428,["They have wasted their lives in drugs, this, that,"]],[431,["all nonsense; and women have another bad habit,"]],[435,["is to gossip."]],[437,["They want to gossip,"]],[440,["gossip about this person, criticize that person."]],[443,["It’s a very bad habit in women to gossip."]],[448,["I never pay heed to anyone who gossips and"]],[451,["I don’t like a person who gossips,"]],[455,["so don’t gossip about things, cheaply, frivolously talking"]],[459,["about others."]],[462,["It’s not necessary you should be educated,"]],[463,["it’s not necessary that you should come from a"]],[466,["very well-bred family, nothing is necessary as long as you"]],[469,["are a Sahaja Yogi. You can be a diamond,"]],[473,["but allow yourself to be cut into the diamond. Allow!"]],[480,["So the reaction from some person was very good,"]],[483,["they absorbed what I said, they took everything inside,"]],[486,["but some of them went off to sleep."]],[489,["Now, if those who were struggling at that time"]],[492,["may not have understood it - it’s a very difficult subject -"]],[495,["I told you it’s a very subtle subject, doesn’t matter."]],[497,["But those who have been like that,"]],[501,["should look after themselves, should find out."]],[506,["I found one thing with left-sided people:"]],[509,["if they can put a candle near their left Swadisthana,"]],[512,["little far, and put one candle before the photograph and"]],[516,["put left hand towards the photograph and right hand"]],[520,["on the Mother Earth, it works."]],[524,["And the candle at the back should be kept a little far away"]],[527,["because it makes sounds, it goes this way, that way, burns."]],[531,["Those who have been taking drugs, not LSD but other drugs,"]],[535,["who are drowsy people, who feel sleepy,"]],[538,["whose brains are destroyed by drug, all those people"]],[542,["can benefit a lot by this. Do it everyday."]],[549,["Going into drug, you never felt your surrender to drugs,"]],[553,["never felt that"]],[556,["it was something that was going to kill you completely."]],[560,["You know so many people are killed, so many are dying,"]],[562,["but you wanted to do that, I don’t know because"]],[565,["your ego said, “All right, go ahead, try this."]],[567,["You are the one, nothing will happen to you.”"]],[570,["That is the ego suggests. So you did it."]],[573,["All right doesn’t matter,"]],[575,["whatever has happened has happened, let us clear it out,"]],[578,["because we are seekers."]],[585,["So those who have really felt one in the lecture,"]],[590,["without any questioning,"]],[594,["should know that they are doing well."]],[597,["Those who were questioning, reflecting, should know"]],[600,["they have ego, and those who were dozing out should know"]],[604,["that they are left-sided."]],[608,["Left side is worst than the right side"]],[611,["because right side can be easily corrected, it shows."]],[615,["It shows outside, people don’t like it."]],[619,["Such a person is criticized, everybody says:"]],[620,["\"He is egoistical\", he is this, that."]],[622,["Everybody knows that such a person goes out like Hitler."]],[626,["But the left-sided person, you see, is very"]],[629,["pitiable and you have very great pity for such a person,"]],[632,["you sympathize and you get lost with that person."]],[635,["They are more dangerous and difficult to be cured,"]],[638,["very difficult."]],[643,["So, it’s not an easy task, we have to work it out."]],[646,["I am trying My level best; you should also help Me."]],[651,["I was thinking that if you can start using little oil"]],[656,["for your head will be a good idea in the night."]],[658,["As Sahaja yogis, you should. I think the hairstyle"]],[661,["should be changed for Sahaja Yogis."]],[663,["This modern, fashionable style won’t suit us."]],[665,["Because this will, we will all have bald heads one day,"]],[668,["I can tell you, and you will see the Sahashrara"]],[671,["with a big dimple here. Better use some nice coconut oil,"]],[676,["rub in your head nicely, and in the night and"]],[681,["in the morning."]],[682,["After all, it doesn’t show much."]],[684,["And comb your hair in a proper way because also I think"]],[687,["if your dresses are like bhoots,"]],[689,["your hair are like bhoots and the bhoots will take over"]],[692,["thinking, “Oh, this is a bhoot sitting down here;"]],[694,["I better take hold of that bhoot.”"]],[696,["So dress up in a way, shouldn’t have hair on your forehead"]],[699,["at all, keep it straight, make it nice and have it"]],[703,["absolutely clean foreheads."]],[705,["We are Sahaja yogis. We have to change our dresses;"]],[707,["we have to change ours styles."]],[709,["You cannot be fashionable like these stupid punks."]],[716,["So we are a type, by our hairstyles people should know that"]],[720,["these are Sahaja yogis."]],[723,["So before you start getting bald, better try putting"]],[726,["some oil in your head."]],[728,["That is some very important thing"]],[729,["that Sahaja Yogis have to do."]],[731,["You can take vibrated oil if you like and I think olive oil"]],[735,["is good, but better than olive oil, I find,"]],[739,["it is coconut oil is better for the growth of the hair."]],[744,["But sometimes you can also put almond oil, is also good,"]],[747,["almond oil for you because if you have any problem"]],[751,["that you feel exhausted or your nerves need attention,"]],[757,["you are nervous type of person,"]],[759,["then almond oil is good for you."]],[762,["And for people who have teeth which are troubling them"]],[767,["they must look after them."]],[769,["No use going to the dentists,"]],[771,["because dentists create problems."]],[773,["Simple thing is to use olive oil and some salt and rub it"]],[776,["on your gums nicely everyday before sleeping."]],[782,["That will keep your teeth all right. You’ll be amazed,"]],[785,["till today I have not been to any dentists."]],[788,["Never been to a dentist"]],[790,["and I hope I wouldn't go to a dentist."]],[795,["So, but one thing is that I have certain bad habits,"]],[799,["one of them is that I brush my teeth quite often."]],[803,["But, don’t use electrical brushes and all that,"]],[806,["but use brushes or use your fingers is the best way is to"]],[810,["rub with the salt and the oil, is a very good for you,"]],[816,["and then allow the whole thing to come out and then wash it."]],[820,["Then the third thing I find in Europe"]],[824,["that you people do not clear your throats,"]],[827,["and your tongues,"]],[829,["which is another thing very much against Vishuddhi."]],[832,["And that must be one of the reasons why"]],[834,["your Vishuddhis are bad."]],[838,["So though it is not in fashionable here, in the West,"]],[840,["but very important thing is to put your"]],[843,["two fingers in the mouth and rub your fingers, not the thing,"]],[848,["fingers and clean your tongue in such a way that"]],[852,["everything comes out in the morning,"]],[853,["is important because that accumulates and then it rots."]],[858,["So this has to be done and may be that you might think that"]],[861,["this is really making noise and all that, doesn’t matter,"]],[865,["you have to clear out your throat,"]],[867,["that’s how you’ll keep your Vishuddhis very clear."]],[870,["This is one of the things and another thing is that"]],[874,["you must always use water, as much as possible,"]],[877,["for washing when you go for your morning ..."]],[881,["water must be used, paper is a very dirty and"]],[884,["unhygienic habit, very dirty and unhygienic habit."]],[888,["But, even if you use paper, you must use water after that."]],[893,["Is very important that all the time the water"]],[896,["should be used as much as possible."]],[898,["For Sahaja yogis, it is a very, very important thing."]],[904,["Now, for some people who will find that they are"]],[908,["on a subtler level, quite on the verge of collapse"]],[917,["in the way that they still have those problems that they"]],[921,["want to sleep with other women and they want to do"]],[924,["all these things, they should give up Sahaja yoga."]],[926,["Best is to leave us alone."]],[928,["We can’t have such useless people with us."]],[930,["So they should give up Sahaja yoga and don’t trouble us"]],[932,["because we can get thousands and thousands in India,"]],[935,["we have no problem, for them it is not difficult,"]],[940,["they are already there. So, those who are still like that,"]],[943,["who are trying to have relations with other women and"]],[946,["having their eyes on other women;"]],[949,["and or the women like that, you see, all this kind of"]],[952,["maniacs, I call them maniacs only,"]],[955,["should give up Sahaja yoga and should spare us."]],[958,["This is for definite."]],[960,["Now, we have always been saying that those who are"]],[962,["very negative people will have to leave Sahaja yoga"]],[964,["and the day will come, so for all of you"]],[967,["it is very necessary that you should try to clean yourself"]],[971,["and never sit with a person who is negative."]],[977,["Never make friendship with a person who is negative."]],[979,["Try to be more helpful to a person who is positive."]],[985,["Clear out yourself.  Clean out yourself;"]],[987,["look after yourself; respect yourself; love yourself."]],[992,["Live with your dignity."]],[994,["Cheapish thing, frivolous thing,"]],[996,["useless thing should not be done,"]],[999,["and make your ego be challenged."]],[1002,["Let somebody insult you and see that"]],[1005,["that you do not answer back."]],[1007,["Just see it, not to get into temper."]],[1011,["Try that your ego doesn’t react."]],[1016,["That can be achieved very easily if you try in the mirror,"]],[1023,["look at yourself and laugh at yourself,"]],[1026,["make fun of yourself."]],[1028,["You think of yourself."]],[1030,["Who are you?  What do you have?  Nothing."]],[1036,["Now today’s lecture was really, was not only,"]],[1040,["was a great lecture, but also it was like mantras."]],[1044,["All good for the brain, and I would say that this lecture"]],[1049,["must be listened to again and again, and to be taken in -"]],[1054,["not to be questioned, not to be questioned, to be taken in,"]],[1058,["to be absorbed."]],[1061,["I hope you understand this."]],[1063,["Now after this Sahashrara Puja I hope you people"]],[1066,["try to maintain the position you have reached."]],[1072,["I would expect all of you to support, to glorify your leaders"]],[1082,["and not in any way debate them, argue with them,"]],[1085,["give them ideas."]],[1087,["Even the wives I have said are not to argue"]],[1090,["with the leaders."]],[1093,["It’s like pulling each other, like they said there"]],[1096,["were some scorpions sent for investigation"]],[1100,["from different places."]],[1103,["And they saw one jar was open, and they said,"]],[1107,["“What is this? This, from this jar all the scorpions"]],[1110,["will jump out.”"]],[1111,["They said, “They cannot, because as one comes up,"]],[1114,["another pulls him down.”"]],[1117,["In the same way we behave. So if there’s a leader,"]],[1122,["this is ego that makes you jealous, and this is ego"]],[1126,["that says that you know better,"]],[1128,["you better give a solution."]],[1131,["Not that you cannot suggest people,"]],[1133,["tell Me also things, but if it doesn’t accept,"]],[1136,["well and good."]],[1137,["That’s a challenge to your ego."]],[1140,["It’s better that he says “no” to you"]],[1141,["so that you see for yourself,"]],[1142,["“Is it my ego still insisting on that position?”"]],[1148,["Now, on the second thing that I have said that"]],[1150,["we should not be drawn by convention."]],[1154,["Like the convention was that, say, this time the English"]],[1161,["felt, the English leaders felt, which was a big mistake,"]],[1165,["that Italians would be inconvenienced if they stay over."]],[1171,["Italians are very large-hearted people, like Indians are,"]],[1175,["they will be overjoyed if they stay over."]],[1177,["But it is the English mind."]],[1179,["It’s the English who cannot tolerate one person staying"]],[1182,["for two days."]],[1183,["They’ll ask you immediately as you go,"]],[1184,["“What time are you leaving?”"]],[1188,["So, it is their mind that worked out that way that"]],[1191,["it will be inconvenient, because they’ll be inconvenienced."]],[1195,["Though they were told, “You could stay here till Monday,"]],[1198,["there’s no problem, you’ll have to pay just ten pounds,”"]],[1201,["but I thought like that. This is an English image"]],[1205,["of being good to others."]],[1208,["Because to them, anybody staying in their house, finished,"]],[1211,["they won’t allow anybody to come inside the house."]],[1214,["Let there be snow or anything outside,"]],[1216,["they’ll just see and talk to them and say."]],[1219,["I’ve een it Myself."]],[1225,["One day we had, I had gone out it was snowing,"]],[1230,["and I saw a lady standing out in the doorsteps"]],[1233,["with a pram and there was a little baby and the other lady"]],[1238,["was an old lady talking from inside,"]],[1242,["just from the chink, in a way that the door was not"]],[1247,["completely opened out."]],[1249,["And when I came back after an hour and so,"]],[1251,["still that lady was standing outside and talking."]],[1253,["This lady didn’t have sense to say that “You come in.”"]],[1257,["But this another lady also did not mind it also because"]],[1259,["she must be doing the same."]],[1271,["So the large-heartedness of anything they cannot understand."]],[1275,["Moreover, there was no problem,"]],[1277,["it was suggested that you can stay here and you can be here."]],[1281,["Now today we had to hurry up a lot."]],[1283,["The whole thing was quite inconvenienced and"]],[1285,["we had to do it because of a slight mistake."]],[1288,["They should have asked Me and I thought you all"]],[1292,["were staying on Monday because this is logical;"]],[1294,["it is sensible."]],[1296,["But because of the conception that we should not"]],[1298,["inconvenience."]],[1301,["It's not only with English, it's possible with anyone of you."]],[1304,["When you start thinking, “I thought,” you are gone."]],[1310,["So this concepts that you have, about things,"]],[1313,["are actually very dangerous things."]],[1317,["I’ve been having experiences of experiences of this stupid"]],[1322,["conventions people have:  “I thought.”"]],[1326,["They try to be good but ultimately try to be nasty."]],[1332,["They are nasty."]],[1334,["So that means there's something definitely wrong"]],[1337,["with the convention they have about things and"]],[1344,["that’s why people, if they were right when they"]],[1348,["were thinking, world would have been a different thing."]],[1352,["But they are thinking at a level where it's just"]],[1356,["everything is sloping down, and you are going downward."]],[1359,["As soon as you start thinking, you go downward."]],[1364,["Such is the defect of your thinking because it is bound"]],[1367,["by the tanks of your conventions."]],[1371,["Whenever you think, you see, you are bound by your"]],[1374,["conventions and you go down."]],[1377,["I didn’t touch many points today which I could have touched,"]],[1381,["like art. I was saying, I was amazed and exuberant,"]],[1384,["like this the flower like this makes me so very happy"]],[1387,["to see a garden."]],[1389,["But to a sophisticated mind, is more rock or"]],[1392,["something nonsensical."]],[1394,["To them, one flower somewhere because rest of the area"]],[1397,["should be their space for their ego."]],[1410,["So they cannot see the beauty, it’s too much, too much,"]],[1414,["even Sahaja Yoga is too much for us."]],[1417,["What are you a little baby or what?"]],[1419,["What is too much?"]],[1422,["You see, as we like a baby we give a bottle,"]],[1424,["so much of milk, so much of milk,"]],[1426,["so Sahaja Yoga is too much for you."]],[1429,["You are draws or what?"]],[1433,["There is no substance in such kind of a nonsense."]],[1436,["That’s why, “This is sophisticated, this is nice,”"]],[1439,["criticize everyone."]],[1440,["People are so frightened even to decorate their houses,"]],[1444,["because it will be criticized."]],[1446,["Better keep it plain, white, just white."]],[1453,["Even the nose they don’t like."]],[1455,["They want to cut out the nose, eyes, everything,"]],[1457,["just have plain."]],[1462,["And imagine, it's the play of the ego"]],[1465,["which wants an individuality."]],[1470,["How they are in just a position with what they"]],[1472,["wanted to see this clearly?"]],[1477,["If you go in a garden, they'll have one, you see, tree"]],[1481,["somewhere hanging in there."]],[1483,["This is supposed to be garden. You say,"]],[1485,["“Where is the garden”? They say, “This is garden.”"]],[1490,["Microscope.  “Where is the garden?”"]],[1493,["“Oh no, we put only one tree at a point you see"]],[1497,["so it becomes important.”"]],[1499,["So this is only a tree here and then you move up,"]],[1502,["then will be another little bush and another."]],[1509,["Everything is too much. Why?"]],[1510,["Because the ego is too much in their heads."]],[1514,["That’s why everything is too much for them."]],[1517,["This stupidity has to go now."]],[1521,["You have to take whatever is good;"]],[1524,["too much you must take and give up"]],[1526,["whatever is too much in you."]],[1528,["That has to be understood."]],[1531,["All these stupid ideas, all kinds of stupid ideas,"]],[1534,["like you want to buy a house, so it’s all right,"]],[1539,["you go and buy a house."]],[1541,["I went round, most of the houses are about"]],[1546,["seven and a half feet height, but they like it."]],[1551,["I said, “Why?”"]],[1552,["“It’s very old.”"]],[1553,["I said, “So what?”"]],[1555,["They said, “But it’s an old house, it is this and that"]],[1557,["and that old house.”"]],[1559,["I said, “But why do you like it?”"]],[1561,["New houses are eight feet, at the most."]],[1564,["So there is no choice."]],[1566,["But why do you want to have a house which is an old house?"]],[1569,["Victorian houses they don’t like. Why?"]],[1572,["Because they are not so conventional,"]],[1576,["they are not so fashionable."]],[1578,["You must have a house where you should break your neck,"]],[1582,["walk into the bathroom in an awkward way."]],[1584,["You can’t even sit or stand, half way hang in the air."]],[1590,["That’s a very house of the character."]],[1594,["And the character is that which makes you awkward and"]],[1597,["feel funny, that person has character, I mean the person,"]],[1601,["if he is absurd, he is queer, weird, he is strange,"]],[1606,["he is a man of character."]],[1608,["This is the situation today."]],[1611,["He is a man of character and he is weird,"]],[1613,["absolutely a strange personality. How is it?"]],[1618,["“You know he came on a bicycle with a half pant.”"]],[1621,["I said, “Really?” The a man of character."]],[1624,["“Yeah, he’s getting arthritis with it.”"]],[1628,["Doing queer, funny stupid things is regarded as"]],[1632,["something of a personality."]],[1634,["Now, as Sahaja yogis, you have to realize that"]],[1636,["you are not that stupid."]],[1640,["You are crowned with your Self."]],[1647,["Now you are not going to behave like these stupid people,"]],[1649,["and their fashions, to give it up."]],[1653,["They laugh at you, you laugh at them."]],[1659,["In a lunatic asylum, if you go, all the lunatics will say,"]],[1663,["“Oh, so you have also come here to join us.” Isn’t it?"]],[1667,["They all think they are the wisest and you get lost with them"]],[1671,["You start thinking, “Am I lunatic myself?”"]],[1676,["So you all when you see such a person"]],[1678,["you should just laugh at him."]],[1683,["Like a lady, she is thought out to be very fashionable,"]],[1686,["came with a dress, you see, very open her body with"]],[1691,["all her bones showing, and this and that."]],[1695,["And we happen to go and see that house Myself and My husband."]],[1701,["So as soon as he saw her, he came back and vomited."]],[1704,["I said, “What’s the matter?’”"]],[1705,["“I saw her; I vomited.”"]],[1710,["And we got into the car, we didn’t enter and we came away."]],[1714,["And she thought she was a very fashionable lady,"]],[1716,["showing her bones, all her body, horrible."]],[1720,["Imagine, like a dead body standing before you."]],[1725,["But a dead body is regarded as fashionable."]],[1728,["Everybody wants to behave like a dead body."]],[1730,["Now, you should see the sense in it."]],[1733,["Otherwise you are not Sahaja Yogis."]],[1739,["You must see the nonsense that is going on and"]],[1743,["you are not a nonsensical personality."]],[1750,["All these things now if you see from a new angle,"]],[1753,["as I told you now, that you are higher personalities,"]],[1757,["that you have achieved a new awareness of your chakras,"]],[1761,["you’ll be amazed your reactions will be very,"]],[1763,["very different. If you see something like this..."]],[1765,["“Ahh!, you say, “Beautiful!”"]],[1768,["But till you have those horrible conventions with you,"]],[1774,["you cannot."]],[1775,["A house which is dilapidated absolutely going to fall"]],[1778,["on your head is, “What a character!”"]],[1782,["The whole character will fall on your head!"]],[1787,["Absurd ideas people have."]],[1790,["Or then they want something modern which is absolutely"]],[1793,["weird and nonsensical."]],[1795,["You see, there was a lady, she built a house, modern,"]],[1800,["and we had to climb up the steps,"]],[1802,["and every steps she had divided into smaller,"]],[1804,["smaller pieces, we were so much worried"]],[1807,["that we’ll all fall off."]],[1808,["You see, every step was made of small, small pieces,"]],[1811,["like a step, you see every step was made into steps."]],[1815,["So when you put your foot there and you don’t know"]],[1817,["where you are putting your foot, you see."]],[1821,["She must have spent a lot of money making that"]],[1823,["kind of a nonsensical thing, but to her,"]],[1826,["she would show everyone, “Now, come along, see this.”"]],[1829,["I refused to go up, I said, “I have nothing to do.”"]],[1831,["I went back. Yes, it doesn’t matter."]],[1836,["As they show resentment, you must show resentment."]],[1840,["Stupid,"]],[1847,["it doesn’t appeal to Me,"]],[1849,["it doesn’t appeal to Me these things."]],[1851,["I have seen. I don’t like it these things,"]],[1853,["the way there's one flower hanging somewhere,"]],[1855,["and anything if I see, I see I don’t like it."]],[1858,["I don’t enjoy it at all Myself."]],[1860,["And if I am the criteria,"]],[1862,["if I am the one who can judge things,"]],[1863,["then I would tell you I don’t like all these nonsense."]],[1866,["The way people dress up these days, they look like clowns"]],[1869,["to Me, lunatics, like I can say brats,"]],[1872,["or you can call them, what do you call them tramps."]],[1875,["You cannot make out one from another."]],[1876,["Lousy pants, you see,"]],[1879,["some grandfather’s pant they are wearing,"]],[1882,["and grandmother’s blouse on top,"]],[1884,["and the ladies walking on the street, see,"]],[1887,["you feel some funny, queer people walking across,"]],[1891,["and they think it is fashionable."]],[1894,["I think from India we should get all old clothes here"]],[1897,["and sell them off for a higher price."]],[1907,["It's very queer, you just look at it, see from this angle,"]],[1912,["standing on the hilltop, just look at these mad people,"]],[1915,["see how lunatic they are, stupid they are,"]],[1918,["how they are behaving, what is their fashion."]],[1924,["If you see the olden times, people used to dress up well"]],[1929,["with all kinds of frills, all kinds of things,"]],[1932,["but this is what they don’t like."]],[1937,["Whatever God has given us should be decorated and respected."]],[1943,["I mean yesterday, the way you did the hall,"]],[1946,["I mean today the way you did the whole of the hall and"]],[1950,["all that, so very beautiful it look, so nice it look."]],[1955,["But somebody would say, “Oh, let us have"]],[1957,["an absolutely plain thing for Mother."]],[1961,["Some dilapidated wall behind which is about to fall down."]],[1966,["\"That would be real character.”"]],[1968,["How can these ideas be acceptable to Sahaja Yogis!"]],[1972,["This I just don’t understand."]],[1981,["And they pay for it."]],[1982,["They pay for these conventions and they pay for all"]],[1985,["these kind of odd things, they do pay for it."]],[1989,["Supposing there is a fashion today to have your haircut"]],[1992,["like this on top, they will pay for it."]],[1995,["Then you cut them another way, they pay for it."]],[2000,["You have to pay for all these misdoings also."]],[2004,["The fashion is: supposing somebody invite somebody"]],[2008,["to your house, you must have a different type of a glass,"]],[2011,["cup and a glass for this, otherwise you are not all right."]],[2017,["And then what find?"]],[2019,["There’s another group of these hippies and those have come."]],[2022,["They’ll give you the dirtiest possible mugs"]],[2024,["that you cannot drink anything."]],[2027,["So either you accept this nonsense or that nonsense."]],[2034,["It’s absolutely absurd."]],[2037,["And you know I have seen Indians when they are in England,"]],[2041,["they just don’t understand, they just cancel them all right,"]],[2044,["cancel them. They are mad people."]],[2053,["The quality of personality is very, very low, very low."]],[2058,["Take it from Me, very low. You might have ego,"]],[2064,["might exist with that ego, but it is very low here."]],[2069,["Accept it. Innocence is missing, auspiciousness is missing,"]],[2077,["cleanliness is missing."]],[2079,["The attraction of simplicity is missing, so artificial."]],[2088,["Even the ideas of simplicity is artificial."]],[2094,["With artificiality how can you have a quality of human life?"]],[2100,["How can you? You become artificial people."]],[2106,["So give up all these conventions."]],[2110,["I am not here to propagate Indian culture as such,"]],[2114,["but I must say if there is any culture it is in India,"]],[2117,["because this is no culture. All becoming."]],[2122,["If you walk about, I mean you look like when I see"]],[2125,["the people around, they look like host of mad people walking."]],[2132,["You see them on the streets, not one person is normal."]],[2135,["America is even worse."]],[2137,["They must do like this, or this like this."]],[2140,["Not one person has a proper face."]],[2149,["It’s a fact I tell you."]],[2151,["With Sahaja Yoga, your quality has come up, it has come up,"]],[2156,["you’ve become that now, so great."]],[2167,["That’s why you do not feel here there is Lakshmi."]],[2170,["They have money but no Lakshmi."]],[2172,["There’s no beauty of that."]],[2179,["It’s so desolate, like a barren land."]],[2187,["Your ego has blown off everything that was beautiful."]],[2194,["You could not tolerate anybody’s art,"]],[2196,["so you would not have any artistic things in the house."]],[2201,["You need not have many things at all, so you have plastics."]],[2209,["Beauty has run away from your lives."]],[2213,["When you talk also it’s fashionable to be arrogant."]],[2217,["Imagine: to be arrogant, to be very dry,"]],[2226,["there’s no beauty in it. It’s all put up show;"]],[2234,["there’s no bravery in it, nothing sublime."]],[2244,["On the subtle form you have lost it;"]],[2246,["that’s why on the gross form you don’t see it."]],[2251,["Whatever you have lost inside, it's shown outside -"]],[2255,["bankruptcy, complete bankruptcy."]],[2259,["So when you see that with others, when I am saying you,"]],[2262,["I am meaning in the others, those who are not yet"]],[2265,["Sahaja yogis in the West."]],[2268,["Try to understand that they are at a much lower level"]],[2270,["than you are, and don’t take to their ideas,"]],[2273,["and their ways and methods."]],[2276,["Just keep yourself alert."]],[2279,["And then you’ll see they’ll run after you."]],[2282,["Ego is like a donkey."]],[2284,["If somebody is ahead of them, they know somebody is ahead"]],[2287,["of them, then they bend their head to that."]],[2290,["And if they see somebody is behind them, then they kick."]],[2299,["So you have your dignity, you have your special style,"]],[2302,["you live with a special style."]],[2304,["Don’t be one of them. Dress up properly, in a proper way."]],[2310,["You may have only two shirts; you may have only three shirts;"]],[2314,["you need not have many, but have something sensible,"]],[2324,["normal, comfortable and also which is not charring to others."]],[2335,["We are the ones who are going to encourage our art,"]],[2338,["we are the ones who are going to bring back all"]],[2341,["that is lost."]],[2342,["We can’t have Rembrandt anymore; we cannot have"]],[2345,["Leonardo da Vinci; we cannot have Michelangelo again."]],[2349,["Finished them all completely."]],[2351,["Here everyone thinks that they are Michelangelo."]],[2357,["We can’t even have, say, Gorky;"]],[2364,["we can’t have William Blake, can we? Of that courage?"]],[2375,["We cannot have Abraham Lincoln, can we have?"]],[2383,["All dwarfs, useless people."]],[2387,["You scratch them and you find"]],[2389,["they are good for nothing, useless."]],[2391,["Out of you only all these great people have to come out now."]],[2397,["And their specialty about them,"]],[2399,["they had their own personality."]],[2400,["They would not give way to any fashions or anything."]],[2404,["They wouldn’t give way to any cheap popularity."]],[2409,["Out of you people all these great personalities"]],[2414,["are to be born."]],[2417,["So for you and for your progeny you have to think,"]],[2422,["\"What are we doing?” in such a great work as it is,"]],[2425,["it’s not only for your enjoyment that we have a seminar,"]],[2428,["nice music, nice food, nice place, we come and enjoy, no!"]],[2433,["Enjoyment is just an advertising department."]],[2446,["You have to really work hard inside, not outside."]],[2457,["No arguments of any kind. Useless,"]],[2465,["simple thing if I say I have to carry, say, this box,"]],[2470,["somebody will come out and say,"]],[2472,["“All right, then I think we should get a van.”"]],[2475,["“No, but van is too much.” “Then what should we do?”"]],[2477,["They’ll go on arguing till that the box is gone,"]],[2480,["everything is done and I come back and I say,"]],[2482,["“Now, what are you doing?”"]],[2484,["“We are discussing “We are discussing how to take the box.\""]],[2486,["It’s already gone."]],[2490,["Such wasteful habits we should give up."]],[2501,["We have to have new wisdom within us."]],[2504,["All this old wisdom, you just throw it away."]],[2507,["Unless and until you don’t do that, your ego won’t go away."]],[2513,["It won’t leave unless and until you decide to throw away"]],[2517,["all those ideas which to you appear to be there."]],[2524,["You have to be like children."]],[2527,["Try to learn something new all the time;"]],[2530,["we are to be open to learn something new all the time."]],[2535,["You have to learn."]],[2536,["You have lost it."]],[2538,["You had something that you have lost it so many."]],[2541,["Instead of going ahead, you have lost it."]],[2544,["You would have been all right if you had remained"]],[2546,["on the right path, you would have achieved because,"]],[2550,["after all, some countries are traditionally very old."]],[2554,["They also got lost - like Greece, you can say, is lost."]],[2561,["Horrible Greek tragedies, I mean, sit down and cry"]],[2564,["for nothing at all."]],[2565,["Nothing has happened, everything is perfect,"]],[2567,["people just go and sit down and cry."]],[2570,["It’s like you make somebody say that “This one is dead."]],[2574,["Let us now feel that he is dead."]],[2576,["Sit down, all of us should cry.”  Stupid as that."]],[2582,["It's all artificially-created problems and"]],[2584,["artificially-created gloom because you have no real gloom;"]],[2587,["you have no real problem;"]],[2590,["they’ve got food to eat; got everything,"]],[2593,["that’s why you are creating problems for yourself."]],[2598,["That’s why you need psychiatrist, you need drugs,"]],[2601,["you need this, you need that. Because you have no problems,"]],[2603,["you want to have some problems, as simple as that."]],[2607,["Those who have problems have to fight with it."]],[2610,["They have no time for all these nonsensical things."]],[2614,["You have too much time."]],[2616,["All your problems are solved, as far as the material things"]],[2618,["are concerned, but still you are very much involved into it."]],[2622,["So now face it, face it clearly,"]],[2631,["that we are not that anymore."]],[2634,["We are different people."]],[2635,["We are no more worms in the mud but we are lotuses,"]],[2640,["we have fragrance, we have powers,"]],[2644,["we are specially blessed. We have a special sense of joy;"]],[2653,["let’s enjoy that and give it to others and"]],[2656,["and be glorified with it, feel the dignity of it."]],[2667,["I am sure that it is going to work out this time,"]],[2670,["that I have done My level best, I think,"]],[2674,["and this lecture should really go through you all."]],[2680,["All right, any questions?"]],[2683,["Can I have some water?"]],[2686,["Any questions you have?"]],[2696,["They might be think I'll drink from here."]],[2701,["Modern idea that may be I'll drink from here."]],[2706,["There's no need to have glass"]],[2708,["Mother may like to drink from there."]],[2719,["All right, any questions?"]],[2739,["In thoughtless awareness."]],[2744,["Now keep it up, keep it up in thoughtless awareness,"]],[2748,["absolutely you're blasted, keep it up. Keep yourself blasted."]],[2754,["That is this ego business."]],[2756,["Little bit still there rudimentary, keep it out."]],[2761,["This is meditation. Where there's no ego any more."]],[2766,["You are in thoughtless awareness, absolutely stuanned."]],[2774,["Can't think."]],[2777,["But I have done, is not good. You should do it."]],[2780,["That is the point I am coming to again."]],[2785,["Have your own personality."]],[2787,["If punks could behave like that,"]],[2789,["why can’t you behave sensibly?"]],[2813,["And also I have to say few words about how we behave"]],[2819,["in our day-to-day live because the Mother has to see that"]],[2824,["they are, children are not to be ill-bred."]],[2827,["People should not say that SahajaYogis are ill bred."]],[2832,["First sign of an ill-bred child is that he leaves his bed"]],[2837,["in a mess. He leaves all his things in a mess."]],[2845,["While coming I saw all the beds."]],[2850,["What are we doing here? Nothing."]],[2854,["So put yourself into a discipline of leading a neat life."]],[2861,["As a Mother I have to tell you this."]],[2864,["It takes hardly ten to fifteen minutes,"]],[2868,["but just tell yourself, \"This is meditation\","]],[2870,["do in meditative way."]],[2873,["We in India think that the Western people"]],[2876,["are extremely neat and tidy."]],[2880,["Really, they can’t believe it."]],[2883,["They think you are in top of the world."]],[2884,["You must be the neatest people ever lived."]],[2889,["They said ten times “thank you.”"]],[2891,["But even once you will not keep your bed all right."]],[2896,["Your things should be neat."]],[2900,["You must keep yourself neat, appear neat."]],[2909,["Then second thing I've seen, noticed this"]],[2911,["which is told by many people which I have also noticed"]],[2914,["that you go to somebody’s house,"]],[2918,["then an ill-bred person will start using the phone"]],[2922,["without asking."]],[2924,["Certain things are important to understand."]],[2927,["Like entering into the kitchen eating everything."]],[2931,["It’s a very common thing people are noticing this,"]],[2935,["that you get the food like paupers, like beggars"]],[2942,["they come in the house."]],[2946,["At least twenty-one bottles of honey"]],[2949,["which people had given Me as present,"]],[2952,["when My son-in-law came there was not even"]],[2955,["one bottle to give him honey."]],[2958,["So who ate?"]],[2960,["All the Sahaja yogis who came and ate the honey."]],[2964,["I mean, it’s all right but you must ask."]],[2969,["You polish off everything in the house."]],[2971,["All right, you have come, there is food cooked for you,"]],[2975,["just have your food."]],[2976,["If you go in the larder or you go anywhere to find,"]],[2986,["everything is missing."]],[2989,["You buy from the whole mart you find everything polished off."]],[2995,["So an ill-bred person can be made out like that."]],[3000,["But you will be surprised, a good breeding person,"]],[3004,["even if this much is left of another person,"]],[3009,["that person will keep it and keep it,"]],[3011,["till it is passed over."]],[3014,["I’ll tell you about My own husband who is,"]],[3016,["who need not worry about this but if he knows"]],[3019,["we have something of another person,"]],[3021,["he’ll  put it lock and key and see every time it is there"]],[3025,["till he returns it to him."]],[3034,["And same I can say about My children or"]],[3037,["anybody I know of, but this is beggarish"]],[3042,["that you take somebody’s things, miss use it,"]],[3045,["throw away where you feel like and break everything."]],[3051,["But I've seen with My own things,"]],[3052,["when the leaders have been complaining to Me that"]],[3055,["come to our houses, they polish off everything"]],[3058,["from our fridges and all that, I was not surprised."]],[3063,["The Sahaja Yoga has become like a resort"]],[3067,["for the all the beggars and the paupers of the world"]],[3071,["because it is free."]],[3073,["All the poor people come down to Sahaja Yoga and"]],[3077,["you have to nourish them and look after them."]],[3080,["It should not be such."]],[3082,["You may be poor but you must have dignity."]],[3089,["Even the servants are in India are better."]],[3095,["They wouldn’t touch your things without asking."]],[3098,["They have much more breeding."]],[3108,["And ill-bred person is a person who is a rude person,"]],[3112,["arrogant person."]],[3115,["You can say the same thing in a proper manner."]],[3118,["As a Mother to give Me a real glory is that,"]],[3122,["that people should say that"]],[3123,["you are very well brought up children."]],[3139,["A kind of system must exist."]],[3145,["A spartan system, it's a spartans system."]],[3149,["It is not all a sort of a lousy system."]],[3153,["It's a spartan system."]],[3155,["We are yogis, should be neat, tidy, all the time clean"]],[3162,["with few things."]],[3166,["Like in India, people are quite shocked."]],[3168,["You carry such big, big bags and it carries all the,"]],[3173,["for ladies, specially all the paints and this and that."]],[3176,["Where are you going to use before the villagers there"]],[3179,["these paints, they don’t understand."]],[3185,["All these things we have to see for ourselves."]],[3189,["We have to be dignified."]],[3192,["We have to be people with a kind of a personality."]],[3201,["Supposing somebody is a saint."]],[3203,["He might be a poor man"]],[3207,["but you can make him out by his dignity."]],[3211,["There was a saint called Tukhaarama"]],[3214,["whom which you have heard about him this"]],[3216,["\"Amhi Bi Ghadalo\" comes from his music."]],[3221,["He was poor and very generous also."]],[3225,["He used to give away everything and he always left"]],[3228,["with very little."]],[3230,["So Shivaji Maharaj, the great Shivaji came down to his place,"]],[3238,["brought  lots of ornaments and things and presentations"]],[3242,["and gave it to his wife and children. He was out."]],[3246,["She was very happy to wear all these things because he gave."]],[3249,["Of course in the beginning she also said,"]],[3252,["“That is  not all right.” But he said,"]],[3253,["“No I am only trying to sort of pay my respect to you -"]],[3257,["this, that - and give. And she wore it."]],[3260,["He came and he said, “No, I am a saint."]],[3267,["You take these. You are a king; you have to live like a king."]],[3271,["All right as a king, you can have it."]],[3278,["But not as a saint. I don’t need all these."]],[3281,["My wife doesn’t need all these things."]],[3284,["Because you are living like a king,"]],[3286,["maybe you are realized soul also but you are a king,"]],[3288,["so live like a king.”"]],[3297,["But one has to realize that in Sahaja Yoga you are not"]],[3302,["to move like a barren personality also."]],[3305,["You have to be properly dressed, properly appearing."]],[3309,["You should not look like beggars,"]],[3312,["but you should look like dignified people of the society."]],[3318,["Now for example, as you know I am the Goddess,"]],[3322,["and the Goddess has to wear, I don't know how many ornaments"]],[3326,["just to adorn Her chakras."]],[3330,["I mean I have lots of ornaments Myself of My own."]],[3335,["But only for puja I wear otherwise I don’t wear."]],[3338,["I am supposed to wear lots of things."]],[3342,["Why? Because it may not be that all right,"]],[3348,["may be dignified but may not be that all right to wear"]],[3350,["all those things all the time."]],[3354,["But I am supposed to wear."]],[3357,["Like I am supposed to wear many more things on the hands"]],[3360,["here, rings on the feet, everything all the time you have"]],[3364,["wear gold in the, what do you call the, you don’t have that"]],[3371,["ornament here which we tie up like a belt."]],[3378,["But I don’t do it."]],[3381,["I keep it to a marginal point"]],[3384,["only in puja I wear some things out of it."]],[3389,["So you must have that discretion what to wear,"]],[3393,["how to wear, how far to go, how to look dignified,"]],[3398,["how to be well bred so that you glorify"]],[3401,["the breeding of your Mother."]],[3412,["This time I hope when you all come to India"]],[3416,["you'll notice all these things among Indians."]],[3419,["You will never see them eating;"]],[3422,["you never see them having their baths;"]],[3424,["you never see them sleeping."]],[3428,["You don’t know how they live, where they live,"]],[3431,["how they work out,"]],[3432,["everything they are just there on the spot"]],[3435,["whenever you are there."]],[3437,["Isn’t it true?"]],[3440,["They take their baths, they finish everything early"]],[3443,["in the morning about 4 o’clock or 5 o’clock."]],[3445,["They are out, spartan and always clean whether a villager,"]],[3452,["whether he is a Shedule caste or Brahmin or anything."]],[3458,["They all neatly dressed; you cannot make them out."]],[3463,["Clean, white clothes they'll wear."]],[3465,["Clean white cap they will have."]],[3471,["They never have dirty clothes."]],[3480,["So this is another side, which is not so sublime,"]],[3486,["gross side and not so subtle but is very important"]],[3491,["because whatever is in the subtle expresses outside."]],[3502,["In all your behavior this will shine,"]],[3508,["like thousands facets of a diamond because"]],[3514,["you have attended now the Sahasrara Day.  Let’s see."]],[3518,["What you have thousand facets we show."]],[3528,["Love each other; respect each other;"]],[3530,["respect yourself and all the time say one mantra"]],[3536,["within yourself “I am a Sahaja Yogi.”"]],[3540,["It says everything about your responsibilities,"]],[3545,["what are your aspirations, what you are."]],[3551,["You are a Sahaja Yogi. Being reborn by Adi Shakti Herself."]],[3568,["Any personal problems you have you should write to Me and"]],[3571,["I’ll try to answer."]],[3573,["If I do not answer, then think that answer I've managed."]],[3577,["If I do not answer then think that I've managed to answer,"]],[3580,["but if there is anything to be suggested"]],[3582,["I will definitely inform you."]],[3585,["Any other problem."]],[3590,["But like a lady today came,"]],[3591,["she was crying about her husband."]],[3593,["She did before also again today she is crying."]],[3595,["She'll go mad."]],[3596,["A Sahaja Yogi should not cry."]],[3601,["Overcome your problems;"]],[3603,["try to handle your husband; try to handle everything."]],[3606,["I do not like very much the divorce part of it,"]],[3609,["but if somebody is a gone case is all right."]],[3611,["I would say is a gone case, you divorce."]],[3613,["But unnecessarily, just because it's not yet a proper"]],[3620,["understanding one should not cry, weep"]],[3622,["and do all these things."]],[3624,["On the contrary one should try to overcome"]],[3627,["your own personal problems because you have powers."]],[3640,["And You can write to Me, not very long letters."]],[3644,["I get lost."]],[3649,["Yes, really I get lost."]],[3658,["In the morning there are so many letters for Me to read,"]],[3664,["one better than the other,"]],[3667,["and My husband also get a big post."]],[3671,["But he says, “Nobody writes me love letters,"]],[3673,["they all write about their bills to be paid.”"]],[3678,["I said, “It’s just the same.”"]],[3699,["You may translate this Gregoire."]],[3713,["Full of problems."]],[3741,["I said that, “I have to pay for their love.”"]],[3746,["That's what it is."]],[3755,["But children write very sweet letters."]],[3758,["They just made some painting or something,"]],[3760,["or some flowers and few things there, that’s all."]],[3764,["They'll make a heart and put Me there or something like that."]],[3768,["Very sweet, sweet things they do and just the joy"]],[3774,["and the happiness you see they express."]],[3778,["Never they've no problems. They have no problems."]],[3781,["Children don’t have problems. They are not complicated."]],[3783,["You catch hold of the problems, that's the trouble is."]],[3786,["They have no problems of any kind."]],[3792,["So you have not told me, anyone of you,"]],[3796,["anything that you want to be done."]],[3798,["Now only thing at the last I would like you"]],[3800,["you to listen to Warren who will read it out"]],[3803,["to you the programs, we are going to have"]],[3806,["in this summer time."]],[4578,["After sometime it may happened that"]],[4580,["I settle down in one place and you all have to come there,"]],[4583,["because I wouldn’t be able to travel so much,"]],[4585,["I can tell you this much ... All right. For the time being."]],[4590,["You must also understand that now"]],[4593,["the Mohamad has gone to the mountains"]],[4595,["now the mountains have to come to Mohamed."]],[4601,["All right. So thank you very much."]],[4603,["You haven't told Me any of your problems"]],[4605,["So, I think, there are no problems?"]],[4632,["Tomorrow morning I may not be able to meet you."]],[4635,["So may God bless you all."]],[4643,["Give yourself a bandhan now, all of you."]],[4645,["Properly, with full attention, with full dignity,"]],[4649,["with full movement."]],[4651,["See, full."]],[4658,["Nothing should be done cheaply."]],[4687,["I don't need anything but lets doing it with yours..."]],[4716,["In India they asked the question that,"]],[4718,["\"If She is the Goddess"]],[4720,["why does She say \"Namaskar\" to everyone?\""]],[4722,["They can't understand the Goddess saying, \"namaskar\"."]]]);
